<title>UK: Aegis half year profit up 15 pct, pays div.</title>
<headline>Aegis half year profit up 15 pct, pays div.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		1.4		    vs 1.2</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 0.25		   vs nil</p>
<p> Pretax		     18.7		   vs 16.3</p>
<p> Turnover		   1,808		  vs 1,674</p>
<p> Operating result	 21.0		   vs 18.4</p>
<p> Interest payable	 2.3		    vs 2.1</p>
<p> Tax			  5.1		    vs 4.1</p>
